          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text1</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>DANH MỤC HƯỚNG DẪN SỬ DỤNG XE CĂN BẢN</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text1>
        <Image1 Ref="7" type="Image" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>2,2,160,34</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Image></Image>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Image1</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Stretch>True</Stretch>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Image1>
        <Text2 Ref="8" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
          <ClientRectangle>10,46,150,10</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,11,Italic</Font>
          <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text2</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>        Để đảm bảo an toàn cho quí khách hàng và xe, Toyota khuyến cáo quí khách nên để nhân viên hướng dẫn, giải thích cách sử dụng các hạng mục sau đây:</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text2>
        <Text3 Ref="9" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>12,58,34,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,11,Italic</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text3</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>(Quí khách đánh dấu</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text3>
        <Text4 Ref="10" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>10,66,150,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,13,Bold</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text4</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>Tất cả các mục dưới đây</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text4>
        <Text5 Ref="11" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>8,74,152,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text5</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>1.Hệ thống an toàn vận hành xe	</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text5>
        <Text6 Ref="12" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>16,82,144,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text6</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>Hệ thống chống bó cứng phanh (ABS)
</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text6>
        <Text7 Ref="13" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>8,114,152,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text7</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>2.Cách sử dụng các thiết bị bên trong xe					</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text7>
        <Text8 Ref="14" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>16,122,144,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text8</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>Cần mở cửa nắp bình xăng, nắp capo, nắp khoang hành lý</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text8>
        <Text9 Ref="15" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>8,178,152,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12,Bold</Font>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text9</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>3.Cách tháo lắp lốp dự phòng</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text9>
        <Text10 Ref="16" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
          <ClientRectangle>2,186,158,16</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12,Italic</Font>
          <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text10</Name>
          <Page isRef="5" />
          <Parent isRef="5" />
          <Text>	Trường hợp khách hàng yêu cầu hướng dẫn ngoài những hạng mục trên, nhân viên hướng dẫn sẽ tiếp tục giải thích cho khách hàng tại khoang giao xe nếu không có khách hàng khác chờ nhận xe hoặc ở khu vực khác.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
          <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
        </Text10>
        <Text11 Ref="17" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>8,202,58,6</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Times New Roman,12</Font>
          <HorAlignment>Center</HorAlignment>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
